# TIN TROOP 4-A, start to finish with plain button presses (recorded once
# from a route plan). No blimp in the toy chest: every soldier marches out
# of the last door passed. A Pop breaks the block wall and lights the wick;
# the next soldier catches fire at it and burns the pen of mice; a stone
# under the tap drains the basin; a stone crushes the spikes; a stone in
# front of the laser eye blinds it.
game tintroop
wait 5
cheat unlock
press A
wait 5
press LEFT
press A
wait 30
press A
wait 5
wait 24
hold RIGHT 104
